<title>USA: US, state regulators target Internet fraud.</title>
<headline>US, state regulators target Internet fraud.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal and state regulators Thursday said they are cracking down on marketers who tout business opportunity schemes over the Internet.</p>
<p>The Federal Trade Commission and the North American Securities Administrators Association said they targeted 215 of the hundreds of ads they identified and warned the marketers they must be able to back up all claims they make.</p>
<p>Regulators said they spent much of the a day combing the Internet for marketers touting the &quot;potentially fantastic earnings&quot; to be made by consumers who buy into their business opportunity schemes.</p>
</text>
